#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:192
#: e81bb96ce547454fbfd7e0a6c764c2a4
msgid "mavp2p"
msgstr "mavp2p"

#: ../../source/docs/raspberry-pi-via-mavlink.rst:194
#: 5a4beb04774a450d85e343b0603a89b3
msgid ""
"mavp2p is a flexible and efficient Mavlink proxy / bridge / router, "
"implemented in the form of a command-line utility. Functioning like "
"MAVProxy's router, mavp2p can replace MAVProxy in companion computers with "
"limited resources. mavp2p has pre-built binaries for most common Raspberry "
"PI architectures. `MAVp2p <https://github.com/aler9/mavp2p>`__."
msgstr ""
"mavp2p 是一款灵活高效的 MAVLink 代理/桥接/路由器，以命令行工具的形式实现。其功能类似 MAVProxy "
"的路由器，可在资源有限的伴飞计算机上替代 MAVProxy。mavp2p 为大多数常见 Raspberry Pi "
"架构提供了预构建二进制文件。`MAVp2p <https://github.com/aler9/mavp2p>`__。"

